                                "sense_id": "09eef9aa-04a4-3ab0-aa8b-a855ed6e8df7",
                                "text": "[…] those gods and men whose titles to eminence are secure, seldom worry themselves about the seditious gossip of old apple-women, and the skylarkings of funny little boys in the street."
